%\bigskip

%Therefore, the contribution of $z_\infty$ in the Guillemin-Sternberg 
%trace formula is:
%$$
%\forall t \in \R\setminus\{0\},\;
%\frac{1}{|1-e^{-t}|} = \frac{1}{| det ( 1-D_y \phi^t(z_\infty)\,;\, T_{z_\infty} S_K/T_{z_\infty}\mathcal{F}) |}
